Subject: [PATCH] test(03-23): add failing tests for the unified scraper
 adapter and ingest origin fields

- legacy adapter calls pinned (scrapeUrl with the URL only, processDocument with source scrape)
- unified scrape and crawl call ingest with the scraper identity, Markdown and provider metadata
- ingest writes provider fields named in options.origin right after begin
- stub scraperPipeline so the switch tests fail on assertions

